      "updated_at": "2018-04-12T06:38:48Z",
      "body": "You should not disable completely the Tracker module.\r\n\r\nIn future versions it will allow you to exploit the collected data (and respect the EU GDPR) to influence search results more than we did ever do.\r\n\r\nPing to smile.fr is only for our internal purposes and nothing more than your domain name is recorded.\r\n\r\nRegards",
