      "body": "We're also disabling that tracking code. However; I really like the idea of using that onsite search data to optimize the customer experience in the future. I've never gotten any updates from Smile on anything via email or online. I'd love to know when that tech is available paid or free. There are some really excellent boutique services charging bank for that type of AI. It would need to be setup with some pretty bulletproof best practices. \r\n\r\nBefore any of that Smile should probably develop a preset for best sellers and new items to auto display at the head of each category. That would eliminate a lot of the manual work we're doing.\r\nPowerful tool for sure when it works, thanks Smile for putting this out.\r\n\r\n[www.sharpcommerce.com](Sharp Commerce Ecommerce Consulting)",
